# Rust / Tauri
/target/
dist/
src-tauri/gen/

# The PP-OCRv6 models for the OCR sidecar (pp-ocrv6-sidecar tickets
# 02/03; tiny-only bundle + Model Packs since deferred-model-packs
# ticket 05, ADR-0008) — fetched by packaging/fetch-pp-ocrv6.ps1 from
# the official Apache-2.0 repos; never committed. Only Tiny's three
# files + the generated models manifest land in the bundle; the rest
# feed the pack archives. The license attribution file IS committed: it
# satisfies tauri's bundle.resources glob (tauri-build rejects an empty
# match) and rides along in the installer, as bundled Apache-2.0 code
# requires.
/src-tauri/resources/pp-ocrv6/*
!/src-tauri/resources/pp-ocrv6/LICENSE-PP-OCRv6-models.txt

# Node (Tauri frontend build)
node_modules/

# Local release-build outputs (docs/releasing.md: the workflow rebuilds
# the installer and the portable zip from a tag on CI; these are the
# same artifacts from a local `cargo tauri build`, never committed).
/packaging/stage/
/packaging/*.zip

# Side CARGO_TARGET_DIRs agents use to build beside the running app's
# locked target/ (test gates, per-ticket builds) — regenerable caches.
/target-*/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local issue tracker — stripped from history at go-public (docs/releasing.md § One-time)
.scratch/
